{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"IMPORTANT: This library is currently in an experimental stage. This means that breaking changes will happen in minor AND patch releases. Upgrade carefully. If you use this in production while in experimental stage, please lock your version to a patch-level version to avoid unexpected breaking changes."}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"npm","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NPM"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular Query is compatible with Angular v16 and higher"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i @tanstack/angular-query-experimental","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"yarn add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"or"}]},{"type":"code","value":"bun add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental","lang":"bash"},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the "},{"type":"link","href":"./examples/simple","children":[{"type":"text","value":"simple"}]},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"link","href":"./examples/basic","children":[{"type":"text","value":"basic"}]},{"type":"text","value":" examples!"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"npm","text":"NPM","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n> IMPORTANT: This library is currently in an experimental stage. This means that breaking changes will happen in minor AND patch releases. Upgrade carefully. If you use this in production while in experimental stage, please lock your version to a patch-level version to avoid unexpected breaking changes.\n\n### NPM\n\n_Angular Query is compatible with Angular v16 and higher_\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nbun add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\n> Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the [simple](./examples/simple) or [basic](./examples/basic) examples!\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: installation\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\n> IMPORTANT: This library is currently in an experimental stage. This means that breaking changes will happen in minor AND patch releases. Upgrade carefully. If you use this in production while in experimental stage, please lock your version to a patch-level version to avoid unexpected breaking changes.\n\n### NPM\n\n_Angular Query is compatible with Angular v16 and higher_\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\npnpm add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nyarn add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\nor\n\n```bash\nbun add @tanstack/angular-query-experimental\n```\n\n> Wanna give it a spin before you download? Try out the [simple](./examples/simple) or [basic](./examples/basic) examples!\n"}
